'''Umber''' is a {{Common}} [[Dwarven Metal]] in the {{Skill|Mining}} Collection.

== Collection ==
Collecting '''Umber''' increases the player's Umber [[collections|collection]], which grants useful items and perks upon collecting certain amounts of Umber.

{{/Collection UI}}

{{CollectionTable|Umber}}

== Obtaining ==
'''Umber''' is obtained from mining {{Item|Hardened Clay}}, {{Item|Brown Hardened Clay}} or {{Item|Red Sandstone}} blocks in the {{Zone|Glacite Tunnels}} or {{Zone|Glacite Mineshafts}}. It requires {{Stat|Breaking Power|9}} to mine. All types have {{Green|5,600}} [[Block Strength]], but the amount of base drops varies.

